  "reason": "2026-10-12 lane D facing fix (user decision: graded look + fix): the Hips [0,55,0] handKeys turn the whole bird (legs, wings and head) ~52 deg off glTF +Z, so freeze_slice's facing gate refused Unit_Idle f0 at 51.9 (cap 45). Hips yaw -17 deg about world up on every clip (whole body, rigid; no Spine counter-rotation: a Hips/Spine twist tears the waist, 7 -> 394 edges past 2x) brings idle-0 to 34.9 while the clips keep the DEF's 3/4 read (board IoU within ~0.02 of the unpatched delivery; a full -52 to +Z drops it 0.71 -> 0.55). Move wing beat (2026-10-12, gargoyle bar): the capture beat the folded wing bones over the back (tailward <-> dorsal, 9..80 deg), which reads as almost no flap; LeftWing/RightWing re-aimed into a spread lateral beat like DEF g00 (15 deg sweep, stroke x1.8 about mid-stroke: up ~+64 / down ~-64 deg), MoveStart/MoveEnd ramped into and out of it; Idle and the other clips untouched.",
